: null, "rationale": "The shader writes positive energy-to-remove; Anomaly merges max(LBuffer.rgb - src.rgb, 0) so the result is format-safe on Keen R11G11B10_Float LBuffer."}, {"id": "readme_lbuffer", "label": "Keen LBuffer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_linear_depth", "label": "linearDepth", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_anomaly_safety_scale", "label": "AnomalySafetyScale", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "March step count is also scaled by AnomalySafetyScale (camera translation / look). Do not globally floor that scale."}, {"id": "readme_quality_presets", "label": "Contact March Quality Presets", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Quality presets change contact march uniforms (steps, max lights, ray distance), not shader permutations."}, {"id": "readme_only_point_light_energy", "label": "Darken Only Point-Light Energy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Vanilla SE only shadows the sun (CSM) and up to four spots; tiled point lights are unshadowed. This pack darkens only that point-light energy at AfterLighting so ambient, sun, spots, and emissive stay untouched."}, {"id": "readme_isolatedsub_format_safe", "label": "IsolatedSub Format-Safe Merge", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contri